  "description": "ADO.NET data access layer for WA.Core (DataBridge): SQL Server and PostgreSQL providers, stored-procedure calls, user/role/session operations on the AspNet* tables without ASP.NET Core Identity. PostgreSQL support added (Npgsql provider) alongside SQL Server.",
