  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 74772,
  "published": "2026-09-24T12:55:59.673Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions. EF Core DbContext (DbRepository) removed and replaced by DataBridge (plain ADO.NET, SQL Server + Npgsql); PostgreSQL stored procedures are called via generated CALL statements, so config keeps T-SQL procedure/parameter names. ASP.NET Core Identity UserManager replaced by hand-written User_* methods on the same AspNet* tables (Identity-compatible password hashes).",
